be1526f29be6ec95b7247.poster.avif?t=1772473078\" width=960 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186770/extras/a62885427aabe1526f29be6ec95b7247.webm?t=1772473078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186770/extras/a62885427aabe1526f29be6ec95b7247.mp4?t=1772473078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>and travel through time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186770/extras/7c5fde71f6d48d591badb5aedfffbcb9.poster.avif?t=1772473078\" width=780 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186770/extras/7c5fde71f6d48d591badb5aedfffbcb9.webm?t=1772473078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186770/extras/7c5fde71f6d48d591badb5aedfffbcb9.mp4?t=1772473078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>to find out the truth and to finish the mission.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the real history behind ancient gold treasures.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is inspired by the oldest known gold treasure in the world, found in the Varna Necropolis, and features historical facts that you uncover during your playthrough as part of the story.\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>After completing the main adventure you unlock &quot;SpeedRun Mode&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dedicated challenge for competitive players. Replay the game, optimize every movement and puzzle solution, and refine your strategy to perfection. With lap times and global leaderboards you can compete with your friends and players around the world in multiple categories. </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I believe the escape room genre is a perfect fit for VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>and that is why I continue to create immersive escape room games. I hope you have as much fun playing this game as I had developing it. Your feedback is always welcome. Enjoy!</strong></p>","developers":["Vasil4N"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186770/316b15ee84cfd7d68db54f8b994088a772fbeed1/header.jpg?t=1772473078","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3186770/126936824/f060f44be3415b5123095ed9494711c8d52bdd5f/1770996098/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770997137","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3186770/126936824/f060f44be3415b5123095ed9494711c8d52bdd5f/1770996098/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770997137","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3186770/126936824/f060f44be3415b5123095ed9494711c8d52bdd5f/1770996098/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770997137","id":257286661,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257286661/e885b93fa93c7df97984f9618fcbdb0ca4e1885d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770997137"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3186770/1586380905/66b4afb1405c5ba16946ec7307246de11ee5a356/1750879128/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757062875","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3186770/1586380905/66b4afb1405c5ba16946e